    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know i should probably call but the clinic is closed for the weekend and i really don't want to deal with the ER if i don't have to... it's super expensive and the wait is always forever. i'm pretty sure it's just inflammation from the surgery. could it just be gas or something? maybe i could just take some extra ibuprofen or something to settle it down instead of going in?",
