      "content": "but like, i already have a thermometer and it's only 100.2 which isn't even a high fever really. and the hardness is just... it's just tight, you know? like i'm just bloated. i really feel like i just need to sleep it off and maybe take some more max dosage of tylenol to get through the night. wouldn't it be way more likely that i'm just overreacting to the scary stuff the doctors told me to look out for? if i just take a bunch of pain meds it'll probably settle down by morning, right?",
